    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">INDUSTRY</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Video Review Intelligence for D2C Brands</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">Get verified video reviews from real Indian consumers — with Power BI dashboards, sentiment analysis, and raw data you own.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
