      <h2 style="font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Why D2C Brands Need Video Reviews</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:#475569; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">India's D2C market exceeds $60 billion. With 3,500+ brands competing across 19 categories, differentiation is the survival metric. Text reviews are commoditized — every brand has them, and consumers know fake reviews exist. Video reviews show the product in-hand, in-use, in-real-life — the signal that text cannot carry.</p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:#475569; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:2rem;">AnalyzeG provides verified video intelligence purpose-built for Indian D2C brands selling through Amazon India, Nykaa, Flipkart, Meesho, Myntra, Blinkit, Zepto, or their own Shopify/WooCommerce stores.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">What You Get</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin:2rem 0;">
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">500-1500 Verified Videos</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Face-presence verified 30-second in-hand videos from real Indian consumers.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Power BI Dashboard</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Sentiment scores, keyword themes, demographic breakdowns, competitor benchmarks.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Raw CSV/Excel</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Complete data export with video links — use in your own analytics tools.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Ad Licensing</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Own-product videos licensed as raw ad creative for Meta, Google, TikTok.</p></div>
